{"name": "Cast Outs", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast Outs</strong> brings you the pure spectacle of magic where spellcasting hits with the physical impact of a brawler and the immediate kick of a shooter. Dive into the <strong>ultimate magical urban battleground</strong> where you and your friends can truly cooperate. It\u2019s the perfect balance of quick-fix fun and high-octane action, <strong>built to be played together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Feel every cast land like a punch, every blast hit like a shot.<br/>It\u2019s a visceral battleground where magic makes an impact, and <strong>you are the difference</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>The real magic comes when spells collide.<br/>Discover and master the endless ways your squad\u2019s powers synergize.<br/>Alone, you\u2019re dangerous. Together? <strong>You\u2019re unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>No two runs play the same. Mutators twist abilities, upgrade powers,<br/>unlock new synergies, and <strong>keep every fight unpredictable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Fight back against an invading horde of orcs, ogres, cyclops, wraiths, dragons and more.<br/>London is your arena and your home - <strong>take it back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Heroes with Evolving Playstyles &amp; Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap heroes to explore new playstyles and synergies. Experiment, remix, and discover new team strategies every time you jump in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blockbuster Action in Bite-sized Sessions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 minutes or all night - Cast Outs delivers fast, high-impact sessions with zero grind, immediate fun, and endless reasons to dive back in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Different Ways to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether 2, 3 or 4 players, you can support the cause to save the city by taking on combat runs, escort missions, horde modes, speed runs and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras_big/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>Built for synergy. Built for friends.</strong> <strong>Built for the stories you\u2019ll be talking about long after the mission ends.</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Urban fantasy collides with true co-op as you and your crew unleash visceral, physical magic, amplifying each other\u2019s powers, and pushing back invaders in the fight to save your city.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/84de36877a124bdaad98919b4d543cfd32366bff/header.jpg?t=1782216383", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Online Co-Op", "PvE", "Class-Based", "Action-Adventure", "Fast-Paced"], "developers": "Twisted Works", "publishers": "Twisted Works", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3307340", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tzXoaCK50Bw", "first_seen": 1782165600.0, "review_rank": 379}